## 🧠 BRAIN-EYE SYNCHRONIZATION SCIENCE

### **Color Wavelength Optimization:**

```
Human Eye Cone Sensitivity:
├── S-cones (Short): 420-440nm → Pravyom Indigo/Purple
├── M-cones (Medium): 530-540nm → Pravyom Emerald
└── L-cones (Long): 560-580nm → Pravyom Gold/Amber

Optimal Contrast Ratios:
├── Navy + White: 16.1:1 (Maximum readability)
├── Navy + Gold: 8.2:1 (Attention + Trust)
└── Navy + Cream: 15.2:1 (Comfortable reading)
```

### **Circadian Rhythm Alignment:**

```
Morning (6am-12pm): Warm colors (Gold, Amber) → Energy
Afternoon (12pm-6pm): Balanced colors (Emerald, Indigo) → Focus
Evening (6pm-12am): Cool colors (Navy, Purple) → Calm
Night (12am-6am): Dark mode (Navy background) → Rest
```

---

## 📊 COLOR USAGE POLICY

### **60-30-10 Rule (Sacred Proportion):**

```
60% - Neutral (Navy backgrounds, Cream surfaces)
30% - Primary (Gold accents, White text)
10% - Accent (Indigo, Purple, Emerald for highlights)
```

### **Hierarchy by Awareness State:**

```
Tamas (Foundation):
├── Navy backgrounds (#0A1628)
└── Cream surfaces (#F5F1E8)

Rajas (Activity):
├── Gold accents (#E8B44F)
├── Amber warnings (#F59E0B)
└── Rose errors (#EF4444)

Sattva (Clarity):
├── White text (#FFFFFF)
├── Emerald success (#10B981)
└── Indigo intelligence (#4F46E5)
```

