## 🎨 GRADIENT SYSTEMS

### **1. Transformation Gradient (Logo-Inspired):**
```css
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E8B44F 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);
/* Gold → White (Dark to Light, Rajas to Sattva) */
```

### **2. Depth Gradient (Background):**
```css
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A1628 0%, #1A2A48 100%);
/* Navy → Lighter Navy (Depth perception) */
```

### **3. Innovation Gradient (Premium):**
```css
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5 0%, #7C3AED 100%);
/* Indigo → Purple (Intelligence to Innovation) */
```

### **4. Success Gradient (Positive):**
```css
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981 0%, #E8B44F 100%);
/* Emerald → Gold (Growth to Prosperity) */
```

