## ✅ ACCESSIBILITY STANDARDS

### **WCAG AAA Compliance:**

```
Text Contrast Requirements:
├── Normal Text: 7:1 minimum
├── Large Text: 4.5:1 minimum
└── UI Components: 3:1 minimum

Pravyom Compliance:
✅ Navy + White: 16.1:1 (AAA)
✅ Navy + Cream: 15.2:1 (AAA)
✅ Navy + Gold: 8.2:1 (AAA)
✅ Indigo + White: 6.8:1 (AA Large)
✅ Emerald + White: 3.9:1 (AA Large)
```

### **Color Blindness Considerations:**

```
Protanopia (Red-blind):
├── Use Navy + Gold (distinguishable)
└── Avoid Rose alone (use with icons)

Deuteranopia (Green-blind):
├── Use Navy + Gold (distinguishable)
└── Emerald has sufficient luminance difference

Tritanopia (Blue-blind):
├── Use Gold + Rose (distinguishable)
└── Navy appears as dark green (still functional)
```

---

## 🎯 BRAND COLOR APPLICATIONS

### **1. Website:**
```
Header: Navy background + White text
Hero: Navy gradient + Gold accents
Body: Cream background + Navy text
CTAs: Gold background + Navy text
Links: Indigo (hover: Purple)
Success: Emerald
Warning: Amber
Error: Rose
```

### **2. Logos:**
```
Primary: Navy background + Gold/White logo
Secondary: Cream background + Navy logo
Icon: Gold gradient (for app icons)
Monochrome: Navy only (for print)
```

### **3. UI Components:**
```
Buttons:
├── Primary: Gold background + Navy text
├── Secondary: Navy outline + Navy text
└── Ghost: Transparent + Navy text

Cards:
├── Background: White or Cream
├── Border: Navy 1px
└── Hover: Indigo border

Inputs:
├── Border: Navy
├── Focus: Indigo
└── Error: Rose
```

